## 4. `include/strata/core/conversation_cache.hpp` — `ConversationCache::take` recomputes `bytes()` after the move

**Responsibilities.** CPU-only ownership and matching policy for parked conversations: prefix matching, budget/slot admission, LRU eviction, retained K/V reuse.

